  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-orange'><div class='task-block-label'>Prozent = Hundertstel</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>Stellt euch die Klassenkasse als einen Balken vor, der in <strong>10 gleich gro&szlig;e St&uuml;cke</strong> geteilt ist. Jedes St&uuml;ck steht f&uuml;r 10&nbsp;%. Ist der Balken ganz gef&uuml;llt, sind das 100&nbsp;% &ndash; also die ganze Kasse.</p></div><div class='task-block task-blue' style='margin-top:12px;'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgabe a)</div><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 6px 0;'>Von der Klassenfahrt-Kasse sind schon 3 von 10 St&uuml;cken gef&uuml;llt (blau).</p><svg viewBox='0 0 280 50' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-width:280px;display:block;margin:8px auto;'><rect x='1' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='#2563eb' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='29' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='#2563eb' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='57' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='#2563eb' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='85' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='none' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='113' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='none' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='141' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='none' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='169' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='none' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='197' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='none' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='225' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='none' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='253' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='none' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='0' y='46' font-size='11' fill='#6b7280'>0%</text><text x='256' y='46' font-size='11' fill='#6b7280'>100%</text></svg><p style='font-size:13px;margin:14px 0 4px 0;'>Wie viel Prozent der Kasse sind schon gef&uuml;llt?</p><input class='cell-input' data-ans='30' placeholder='Wie viel %?'></div><div class='task-block task-green' style='margin-top:12px;'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgabe b)</div><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 6px 0;'>Eine Woche sp&auml;ter sind schon 7 von 10 St&uuml;cken gef&uuml;llt (gr&uuml;n).</p><svg viewBox='0 0 280 50' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-width:280px;display:block;margin:8px auto;'><rect x='1' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='29' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='57' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='85' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='113' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='141' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='169' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='197' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='none' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='225' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='none' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='253' y='0' width='26' height='32' fill='none' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='0' y='46' font-size='11' fill='#6b7280'>0%</text><text x='256' y='46' font-size='11' fill='#6b7280'>100%</text></svg><p style='font-size:13px;margin:14px 0 4px 0;'>Wie viel Prozent der Kasse sind jetzt gef&uuml;llt?</p><input class='cell-input' data-ans='70' placeholder='Wie viel %?'></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(1)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(1)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-1'></span></div>",
  "sol_html": "<div style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;'>a) 3 von 10 St&uuml;cken gef&uuml;llt = <strong>30&nbsp;%</strong><br>b) 7 von 10 St&uuml;cken gef&uuml;llt = <strong>70&nbsp;%</strong></div>"
